      "id": "note12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 298,
      "height": 113,
      "text": "• L4 LB = TCP/UDP ports & IPs\n• L7 LB = HTTP path/host/headers\n• TLS often discussed near\n  presentation / app edge\n• You rarely design L1–L2,\n  but the vocabulary matters",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• L4 LB = TCP/UDP ports & IPs\n• L7 LB = HTTP path/host/headers\n• TLS often discussed near\n  presentation / app edge\n• You rarely design L1–L2,\n  but the vocabulary matters",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
    },
